<title>USA: Delaware Group starts fixed income fund.</title>
<headline>Delaware Group starts fixed income fund.</headline>
<dateline>PHILDAELPHIA 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delaware Group said it has started a fixed-income securities fund that will invest in high-yield corporate and government-backed issues and international sectors.</p>
<p>Up to 10 percent of the Strategic Income Fund can be invested in U.S. stocks.</p>
<p>The fund became available on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Delaware, a unit of Lincoln National Corp, manages about $11 billion in fund assets.</p>
